SUMMARY:Creator's Camp
DESCRIPTION:Creator’s Camp:\nMaking & Growing Together!\nThis faith-infused creative journey combines art\, music\, theater\, gardening\, cooking\, mindfulness and more\, where kids learn to create and nurture! The week wraps up with a heartwarming final sharing when families and friends can cheer on their young creators and see their beautiful lights shine! \nClick here to learn more about these two exciting camps!
